{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object, check properties, do task. Move to visible object if necessary. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToVisibleObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />",
